!Series_summary = To determine if MYCL or EP400 knockdown would affect Max target genes in Merkel cell carcinoma cell line MKL-1, we performed RNA-seq analyses of MKL-1 cells inducibly expressing shMYCL and two different EP400 shRNA -2, -3  and compared to ChIP-seq data using BETA analyses.
!Series_overall_design = MYCL or EP400 was inducibly reduced with shRNA in MKL-1 cells to analyze gene regulation.
!Series_type = Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing
